  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to (i) improve energy security by increasing the clean energy share in the country&amp;apos;s energy mix, which is dominated by fossil fuel generation (over 97%); and (ii) contribute to sector reforms for better governance and public-private partnership (PPP) enabling environment in the development of renewable energy.</narrative>
  </description>
